          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "fe82f709-4788-47f3-a9cd-99091e3d14a4",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "No clues yet for\nthis mission.\nFollow the next\nlead in START >\nStory."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "454bc393-91a3-4ba3-a6f5-1340d783a1a8",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "c99f8e3b-a6a7-45d5-a7d3-1e35b344122a",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "The packet stays\ndry in a tin\nsleeve. Page ONE\ndefines the\nservice",
                "hall. Page TWO\ngrants pipe\naccess. Page THREE\nforbids closing\npublic",
                "branches for\nprivate priority.\nIts seal matches\nthe archive\nsquare,",
                "not Slush's silver\nstationery."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ca79fd58-202f-4076-a9a3-da9a2e4ca1a8",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "4163c500-7d79-4602-af36-8a5b006bdd15",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "An estate summary\nsays the lodge may\nreserve all heat\nafter paying",
                "an inspection\ninvoice. Page TWO\ngrants service\naccess, not",
                "ownership. Page\nTHREE forbids\nclosing public\nbranches for\nprivate",
                "priority. The\nsummary is\nunsigned; both\nnumbered pages\ncarry the",
                "city seal. Nib\nrecognizes his old\nphrasing in the\nsummary and admits",
                "he repeated a\nclaim he had not\nchecked. He asks\nto correct it\nwhere",
                "everyone can see."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d12d7936-2a01-440d-a59c-fc5d10b14767",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "f3413463-4eed-49ed-aab7-ee45d6c6a785",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Nib: The signature\npage refers to TWO\nfor the access\nright. THREE",
                "limits how that\nright may be used.\nThe clerk needs\nthe access page",
                "first, then its\nlimit. I could\nturn this into a\nspeech. I am",
                "choosing to turn\nit into a packet."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6b4251da-f48b-4f46-a787-bb04cf6171f0",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 3
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "faabb2fc-7675-4f29-aaaf-4d145b643c4e",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Which numbered\npage establishes\nthe right to enter\nfor pipe repairs?"
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8efd51ba-88ae-41f0-ab36-c56d45f02748",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 4
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "e4249bce-edff-4b99-a8c6-89529b177768",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Which claim should\nreplace the\nunsigned priority\nsentence? The",
                "signed pages still\ngive useful repair\naccess, so the\ncorrection must",
                "not erase that\nright. Compare\nwhat each document\npermits, and let",
                "the sealed terms\ngovern the\nsummary. Nib will\nput his name\nbeneath",
                "the correction,\nincluding the\nuncomfortable\nsentence that the",
                "earlier claim was\nhis mistake."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "66f63139-b80a-4094-af03-e992b60c935e",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 5
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "41f30fd6-7f36-40e7-a2d6-d21a6a9b1d58",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "The clerk posts\nthe packet beside\nthe wheel. Private\nrooms remain",
                "private; public\nservice stays\npublic. Slush asks\nfor clear fault",
                "reports in return.\nPip accepts the\nduty and names\nMoxie as the",
                "person who will\ncarry reports if a\nwire fails."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    }
  ]
}
